OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCold. Spells of sunshine mixed
OL,6,Fwith occasionally wintry showers,
OL,7,Fthese most frequent over Caithness and
OL,8,FSutherland through the morning.
OL,9,FBecoming mostly dry during the
OL,10,Fafternoon as northerly breezes turning
OL,11,Fto the southeast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly dry through the
OL,14,Fevening with a early frost. Staying
OL,15,Fdry in the west overnight but a few
OL,16,Fshowers will feed into eastern parts,
OL,17,Fparticularly towards Caithness.
OL,18,FFreshening easterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
