OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers at first, turning to longer
OL,7,Fperiods of rain and hill snow in the
OL,8,Fsouth. Drier with some showers in the
OL,9,Fnorth. Fresh easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FWednesday starts rather cloudy with
OL,13,Fsome patchy rain, dry and bright
OL,14,Fspells developing before some showers
OL,15,Flater. Thursday and Friday chilly but
OL,16,Foften dry and bright, some showers in
OL,17,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
